// THE ARRIVAL JOB'S WET DOOR (review 77263, review 77435, review 77746). Re-runs credential-free
// admit so WIF cannot outrun a refused subject, then requires WorkloadIdentityToken (the minted
// WIF bearer, in-process — not interpolated onto argv), takes arrival_archive_slot_acquire, and
// arrival_archive_slot_release. It does not fold a dry/unobserved PriorLifeBoundary into
// ExitSuccess: that would be fabricated plausible output (gunbc.design_argument::fail_closed). Until a live BMC/archive
// observation is bound as the prefix input, the held door refuses with a typed cause. Witnesses
// still supply a DryPriorLifeWorld to converge_mtjade1_arrival_prefix. BMC account writes and
// the pinned bmc-mtjade1-gunbc accessor stay behind this door: the locus is
// SecretLocusReservedNotOnAccessorRoster until FamilyObserved.

